{"id":"3cca93ccf127333f","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-recursive-function.md","title":"Recursive Function","display":"df-recursive-function — Recursive Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-recursive-function","aliases":["57-df-recursive-function"],"display":"df-recursive-function — Recursive Function","depends_on":["[[57-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[57-df-recursive-function-class]]","[[57-df-partial-function]]","[[57-df-composition-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-recursive-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-recursive-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-recursive-function — Recursive Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6198f000bea16af4\" href=\"?note=6198f000bea16af4\" title=\"57-df-primitive-recursive\">57-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4bf1a2a7d352c15e\" href=\"?note=4bf1a2a7d352c15e\" title=\"57-df-recursive-function-class\">57-df-recursive-function-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cda5e2779ea7246f\" href=\"?note=cda5e2779ea7246f\" title=\"57-df-partial-function\">57-df-partial-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7463e44f61370c84\" href=\"?note=7463e44f61370c84\" title=\"57-df-composition-operator\">57-df-composition-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 为候选集合图；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_k\">\\(D_k\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>）及一元函数的打包约定取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7463e44f61370c84\" href=\"?note=7463e44f61370c84\" title=\"57-df-composition-operator\">57-df-composition-operator</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Partial}\">\\(\\mathrm{Partial}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"cda5e2779ea7246f\" href=\"?note=cda5e2779ea7246f\" title=\"57-df-partial-function\">57-df-partial-function</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartRec}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4bf1a2a7d352c15e\" href=\"?note=4bf1a2a7d352c15e\" title=\"57-df-recursive-function-class\">57-df-recursive-function-class</a>。保留原 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Partial}^{90},\\mathrm{PartRec}^{90}\">\\(\\mathrm{Partial}^{90},\\mathrm{PartRec}^{90}\\)</span> 的历史兼容名字，但其定义及全部依赖已在本册内部；上标不再指向缺失文件。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\)</span> 仍表示部分递归性；原始递归子类见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6198f000bea16af4\" href=\"?note=6198f000bea16af4\" title=\"57-df-primitive-recursive\">57-df-primitive-recursive</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 为集合；兼容别名的参数次序仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,A,B\">\\(f,A,B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Partial}^{90}(f,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Partial}(f,A,B),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PartRec}^{90}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartRec}(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Partial}^{90}(f,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Partial}(f,A,B),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PartRec}^{90}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartRec}(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;[\\mathrm{Partial}^{90}(f,D_k,\\mathbb N)\\land\\mathrm{PartRec}^{90}(f)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;[\\mathrm{Partial}^{90}(f,D_k,\\mathbb N)\\land\\mathrm{PartRec}^{90}(f)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>部分函数类通过已明确给出的递归闭包定义，不依赖尚未定义的程序枚举。Rec(f) 不附加全定义性；需要全递归性时另要求定义域为整个输入域。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"6198f000bea16af4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"4bf1a2a7d352c15e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"cda5e2779ea7246f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-composition-operator","status":"resolved","id":"7463e44f61370c84","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-composition-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-composition-operator","status":"resolved","id":"7463e44f61370c84","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f$ 为候选集合图；$D_k$（$k\\in\\mathbb N$）及一元函数的打包约定取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]。$\\mathrm{Partial}$ 取 [[57-df-partial-function]]，$\\mathrm{PartRec}$ 取 [[57-df-recursive-function-class]]。保留原 $\\mathrm{Partial}^{90},\\mathrm{PartRec}^{90}$ 的历史兼容名字，但其定义及全部依赖已在本册内部；上标不再指向缺失文件。$\\mathrm{Rec}(f)$ 仍表示部分递归性；原始递归子类见 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"cda5e2779ea7246f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f$ 为候选集合图；$D_k$（$k\\in\\mathbb N$）及一元函数的打包约定取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]。$\\mathrm{Partial}$ 取 [[57-df-partial-function]]，$\\mathrm{PartRec}$ 取 [[57-df-recursive-function-class]]。保留原 $\\mathrm{Partial}^{90},\\mathrm{PartRec}^{90}$ 的历史兼容名字，但其定义及全部依赖已在本册内部；上标不再指向缺失文件。$\\mathrm{Rec}(f)$ 仍表示部分递归性；原始递归子类见 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"4bf1a2a7d352c15e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f$ 为候选集合图；$D_k$（$k\\in\\mathbb N$）及一元函数的打包约定取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]。$\\mathrm{Partial}$ 取 [[57-df-partial-function]]，$\\mathrm{PartRec}$ 取 [[57-df-recursive-function-class]]。保留原 $\\mathrm{Partial}^{90},\\mathrm{PartRec}^{90}$ 的历史兼容名字，但其定义及全部依赖已在本册内部；上标不再指向缺失文件。$\\mathrm{Rec}(f)$ 仍表示部分递归性；原始递归子类见 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"6198f000bea16af4","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f$ 为候选集合图；$D_k$（$k\\in\\mathbb N$）及一元函数的打包约定取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]。$\\mathrm{Partial}$ 取 [[57-df-partial-function]]，$\\mathrm{PartRec}$ 取 [[57-df-recursive-function-class]]。保留原 $\\mathrm{Partial}^{90},\\mathrm{PartRec}^{90}$ 的历史兼容名字，但其定义及全部依赖已在本册内部；上标不再指向缺失文件。$\\mathrm{Rec}(f)$ 仍表示部分递归性；原始递归子类见 [[57-df-primitive-recursive]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"D_k","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Partial}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartRec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Partial}^{90},\\mathrm{PartRec}^{90}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"f,A,B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Partial}^{90}(f,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Partial}(f,A,B),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PartRec}^{90}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartRec}(f).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;[\\mathrm{Partial}^{90}(f,D_k,\\mathbb N)\\land\\mathrm{PartRec}^{90}(f)].","display":true}],"bytes":1476,"backlinks":[{"id":"ffb90a5e7b76ea84","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本文件使用 [[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]] 的一元数值层级及 $\\chi_A$，$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，自然数见 [[57-df-omega]]。$\\mathrm{Rec}(f)$ 是 [[57-df-recursive-function]] 的部分递归函数谓词；$A\\in\\mathrm{Rec}$ 是下述本地集合类重载，不把函数和自然数集混为一类。"},{"id":"d6a5ff61521a8f18","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$、$r\\geq1$、$k\\in\\mathbb N$；关系 $A\\subseteq\\mathbb N^r$ 以其特征函数 $\\chi_A$ 表示。$\\mathrm{Rec}(\\chi_A)$ 见 [[57-df-recursive-function]]；$\\chi_A$ 本身是总函数，因此这里表达可判定性。自然数见 [[57-df-omega]]。本文件的层级作用于**数值关系**，不与另一个文件的原始语法公式集合混同；$\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0,\\Delta_n^0$ 是一元实例的原接口，额外下标 r 仅用于明示投影元数。"},{"id":"373da07803c26744","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"额外的有效性接口使用一个固定的有限串编码 $\\operatorname{str}:\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N$：$\\pi(a,b)=2^a(2b+1)-1$，$\\operatorname{str}(\\varepsilon)=0$，$\\operatorname{str}(\\langle a\\rangle^\\frown s)=\\pi(a,\\operatorname{str}(s))+1$。固定单射 $b:L\\to\\mathbb N$，其像、各符号分区的像和元数函数的图可判定；变量按 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]] 的既有枚举 $v_i=v(i)$ 编码；本文件的 $V$ 是该枚举函数的局部别名，不是该来源中作为余域的集合 $V$。$\\operatorname{tok}(e)$ 是表达式 $e$ 的完全括号化前缀串，递归式如下；$\\frown$ 为串连接。$\\mathrm{Rec}(h)$ 对函数使用 [[57-df-recursive-function]] 的接口，下面同时要求 $h,d$ 为总函数。"},{"id":"a27c6e4aaf7a32c7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$g:\\mathbb N^{n+1}\\to\\mathbb N$ 为总函数；$\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n$。递归性见 [[57-df-recursive-function]]；以下定义本身只用 $g$ 的全定义性。"},{"id":"4bf1a2a7d352c15e","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本条的 Rec_n 是全递归函数类；PartRec_n 允许发散。原 [[57-df-recursive-function]] 的 Rec(f) 仍指部分递归性，未改成这里的全性条件。这个闭包不使用程序编号或 T 谓词，因而不与后续编号定义循环。"},{"id":"43ca2d9b7fc5df00","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"68e2d5e250a907ad","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\ge1$，$f\\in\\mathcal P_k$；$D_k$、数值元组及打包映射取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]。输入和输出使用 [[57-df-encoding]] 的同一 $\\operatorname{wordenc},\\operatorname{Word}_k$ 表示。$\\mathrm{Effective}_{\\iota_X,\\iota_Y}$ 取 [[57-df-effective-procedure]] 的机器谓词，底层机器取 [[57-df-turing-machine]]；$\\mathrm{Rec}(f)$ 取 [[57-df-recursive-function]]。本环境固定 $X=D_k,Y=\\mathbb N,\\iota_X=\\operatorname{in}_k,\\iota_Y=\\operatorname{out}$。正规形对应取 [[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]。"},{"id":"4c97a440c08bba55","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"97ed617d0dc0e7f2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 是总递归函数：$\\mathrm{Rec}(f)$ 见 [[57-df-recursive-function]]。$\\varphi_e$ 固定为 [[57-df-phi-e]] 的可接受程序编号的一元部分函数图；不能替换为任意无有效参数化性质的枚举。"},{"id":"9189845d6da5bd4f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\ge1$，$R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k$，$\\chi_R$ 是取值为 $0,1$ 的总特征函数。$\\mathrm{Recursive}(R)$ 在本文件表示 $\\mathrm{Rec}(\\chi_R)$，见 [[57-df-recursive-function]]。$\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)$ 互异；$\\vdash$ 是 [[57-df-hilbert-derivable]] 的标准一阶关系。$\\mathrm{Representable}(R,T)$ 是 [[57-df-representable]] 的 $\\mathrm{Rep}_T(R)$ 的兼容写法；$Q$ 见 [[57-df-robinson-arithmetic]]。"},{"id":"618553e8457e6561","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 是总递归函数：$\\mathrm{Rec}(f)$ 见 [[57-df-recursive-function]]。$\\varphi_e$ 固定为 [[57-df-phi-e]] 的可接受程序编号的一元部分函数图；不能替换为任意无有效参数化性质的枚举。"},{"id":"14f0accd0b75a0b1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-85","l